{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/394595-what-are-my-options-for-a-hard-copy-of-demon","id":394595,"title":"What are my options for a hard copy of Demon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-06T01:08:57-08:00","id":394595,"title":"What are my options for a hard copy of Demon?","content":"Demon remains the one NWoD corebook hard copy I don't own, and I'm looking to change that, but I'd like to know what my options are.<br /> <br /> I know DriveThru has two different PoD editions, but I've heard that the cheaper one has some structural issues from multiple people. And even then, $50 is pretty steep. I paid $40 for the nicer version of the Mummy book on Kickstarter. That's about what I'm looking to spend, and what I expect to spend for this kind of product. I was really hard up for cash during the Demon prestige KS period. $80 plus shipping for the nicer version is a bit too much of an investment for a line I'm not 100% in love with yet. eBay and similar sites all seem to have zero hits.<br /> <br /> Is there any way I can go through a retailer to get a better deal, other than hoping they have a used copy of the nicer PoD? Will I be really unhappy if I spend $50 on the cheaper one? (Not with the text of the book, I'm talking about the actual binding/printing, which I've heard not so good things about.) Just looking to round out my collection without breaking the bank. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4953,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4953-asatj","user":"AsaTJ","date":". 02-06-2015, 04:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4953-asatj","name":"AsaTJ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4953_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T09:06:22-08:00","id":394969,"title":"","content":"The only non-PoD copies of Demon made are the prestige run for the Kickstarter, which were also made to order, so going through a retailer would mean looking for a retailer who ordered the retailer tier of Kickstarter prestige editions and hasn't sold out by now.<br /> <br /> I don't have any standard color PoDs the size of the Demon core, but from my copy of the GMC, I can say that my experience with it isn't as bad as it sounds like you've heard. The binding is fine and sturdy; it's in no danger of falling apart. The pages <i>are</i> thinner, and if I were to be flipping through a corebook a lot I personally would feel more comfortable with the premium pages so I wouldn't be worried about accidentally tearing them, but for casual reference it should be fine.<br /> <br /> So I would say that <i>if</i> the PoD holds up the same at larger book sizes (I'm not certain), it's a matter of how much wear and frequent use you expect to be putting on the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T09:13:02-08:00","id":394976,"title":"","content":"I've been pretty rough on my premium books, actually, and they've come up fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T10:16:47-08:00","id":395087,"title":"","content":"I have all three print options of demon. And I can tell you first hand that the cheaper version of the pod is still a solid book. The pages are thinner yes but the quality of book remains pretty on par. I've been running demon since May and I've suffered more wear on my higher cost pod books ( they're huge and thick enough to be gadgeted with knock out punch). You're fine going the less expensive route. Had I'd been thinking I would have bought all cheaper pods instead of two of the standard and two of the high quality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T12:26:12-08:00","id":395253,"title":"","content":"At Gen Con I was telling people the Demon rulebook doubles as a home defense device.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T19:21:29-08:00","id":395764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AsaTJ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/394595-what-are-my-options-for-a-hard-copy-of-demon#post394595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know DriveThru has two different PoD editions, but I've heard that the cheaper one has some structural issues from multiple people. And even then, $50 is pretty steep. I paid $40 for the nicer version of the Mummy book on Kickstarter.</div> </div> </div> </div>Demon is about twice the size of Mummy. Only paying $10 more seems like good value. <br /> <br /> I have the premium colour version of DtD and it's well constructed and robust. I have the standard B&amp;W PoD of W20, which is bigger than DtD, and it's also robust and stands up to very frequent referencing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T06:38:16-08:00","id":396244,"title":"","content":"I've got two, the Kickstarter edition (which I never use, since it's so pretty) and the cheapest PoD version (which I use all the time, since I have a spare). It's not as crisp and the pages are thin but despite the incredibly intense use I've been putting that book through recently the pages haven't even creased, let alone torn. The binding is absolutely fine. <br /> <br /> I admit, for the sake of a pretty collection I would always go Premium, but if you're looking to save ten dollars you'll be fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}